{"id": "train-4347", "text": "地梗鼠尾(唇形科)。【苗药】活血丹，里章白：全草强筋壮骨，补虚益损《湘蓝考》。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "label": "Species"}, {"start": 5, "end": 8, "label": "Family"}, {"start": 11, "end": 13, "label": "Original"}, {"start": 14, "end": 17, "label": "Name"}, {"start": 18, "end": 21, "label": "Alias"}, {"start": 22, "end": 24, "label": "Part"}, {"start": 24, "end": 28, "label": "Symptom"}, {"start": 29, "end": 33, "label": "Symptom"}, {"start": 34, "end": 37, "label": "Pharmacopoeia"}]}
